# Deploy guide rendered by scripts/mesh_setup.py for one particular install.
# The tracked templates are deploy/*.example; this is the filled-in result, and it
# carries that machine's paths, service user and hostname — which this being a
# public repo makes a reason on its own. Unanchored because mesh_setup.py chooses
# the location at runtime (see its `deploy_base`): normally <collector>/scripts,
# but beside the script itself when run against a reused checkout.
deploy-guide/


